WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.025 --> 00:00:07.865
"Now what?"

2
00:00:09.726 --> 00:00:18.348
Zann stared at the wormhole, which had swirled open at their approach.

3
00:00:18.368 --> 00:00:22.089
"I guess the Directory was right," Darb said.

4
00:00:22.109 --> 00:00:23.949
"Morb isn't in Magica."

5
00:00:23.969 --> 00:00:27.150
"Yet." Saffa reminded everyone.

6
00:00:27.170 --> 00:00:31.251
"This could be our chance to find him and stop him before he gets here."

7
00:00:32.432 --> 00:00:33.192
Fala nodded.

8
00:00:33.472 --> 00:00:35.353
"We should tell Venna what's going on."

9
00:00:35.373 --> 00:00:38.174
"Good idea," Saffa said.

10
00:00:38.194 --> 00:00:41.876
"But this news is too important to entrust to a message moth.

11
00:00:42.376 --> 00:00:43.957
Someone might intercept it."

12
00:00:43.977 --> 00:00:46.338
"You're right," Fala said.

13
00:00:46.358 --> 00:00:48.679
"I'll go speak to Venna in person."

14
00:00:49.639 --> 00:00:51.900
She rubbed her hands together and zapped away.

15
00:00:52.581 --> 00:00:56.403
As the others waited, they heard shouts from the area near Wyssa's old hut.

16
00:00:57.423 --> 00:00:59.284
There was a burst of magical energy.

17
00:01:00.204 --> 00:01:03.646
People peeked out from nearby shelters to see what was going on.

18
00:01:04.887 --> 00:01:06.108
Saffa looked uneasy.

19
00:01:06.128 --> 00:01:10.531
"I hope nobody starts wondering what we're doing by the wormhole."

20
00:01:11.712 --> 00:01:12.652
Fala reappeared.

21
00:01:12.672 --> 00:01:16.035
"Things are getting worse," she said breathlessly.

22
00:01:16.055 --> 00:01:18.476
"I spoke to Venna.

23
00:01:18.857 --> 00:01:20.658
She's still safe—for now.

24
00:01:21.859 --> 00:01:23.920
But the guards are looking for you, Saffa."

25
00:01:25.141 --> 00:01:25.661
She turned.

26
00:01:25.681 --> 00:01:27.462
"And you too, Zann."

27
00:01:28.603 --> 00:01:29.384
Zann gulped.

28
00:01:29.992 --> 00:01:31.653
Then he glanced at Saffa.

29
00:01:32.834 --> 00:01:35.335
"Sounds like it'll be safer for all of us in the vortex.

30
00:01:36.155 --> 00:01:36.856
We should go now."

31
00:01:36.876 --> 00:01:39.477
"What about Zing and the goose?"

32
00:01:39.697 --> 00:01:40.238
Darb said.

33
00:01:40.258 --> 00:01:42.339
"We can't abandon them in the hatch."

34
00:01:43.479 --> 00:01:45.481
"I'll stay behind with them," Fala said.

35
00:01:45.501 --> 00:01:48.842
"I can use the Remote Eye to keep an eye on things."

36
00:01:49.703 --> 00:01:51.524
Zann remembered the Remote Eye.

37
00:01:52.324 --> 00:01:56.787
It was an old-fashioned magical device that could be used to see long distances.

38
00:01:56.807 --> 00:01:58.888
"Good idea," he said.

39
00:01:59.784 --> 00:02:02.845
Another series of shouts and shrieks rang out from the huts.

40
00:02:02.865 --> 00:02:07.987
"Let's not waste any more time," Saffa said anxiously.

41
00:02:08.007 --> 00:02:09.668
"Be careful."

42
00:02:10.008 --> 00:02:13.230
Fala patted Zann on the shoulder and then nodded to the others.

43
00:02:13.250 --> 00:02:15.250
"I'll see you when you return."

44
00:02:16.051 --> 00:02:16.951
She zapped away.

45
00:02:18.132 --> 00:02:19.752
Saffa stepped toward the wormhole.

46
00:02:19.772 --> 00:02:20.673
"Let's go."

47
00:02:20.693 --> 00:02:23.354
"Wait!" Perda said.

48
00:02:23.374 --> 00:02:25.675
"Shouldn't we do a Shackle spell?"

49
00:02:25.695 --> 00:02:28.636
"Why?" Saffa looked confused.

50
00:02:29.564 --> 00:02:31.205
Zann and his friends looked at each other.

51
00:02:31.225 --> 00:02:34.207
"Have you ever been in the vortex before?"

52
00:02:34.527 --> 00:02:35.668
Zann asked Saffa.

53
00:02:36.349 --> 00:02:36.909
She shrugged.

54
00:02:36.929 --> 00:02:38.470
"I've read about it.

55
00:02:38.870 --> 00:02:42.353
And of course I've discussed it with Nax and Asta and others."

56
00:02:43.393 --> 00:02:44.174
Zann winced.

57
00:02:44.974 --> 00:02:49.037
He remembered how overwhelming the vortex was during his first adventure through it.

58
00:02:49.778 --> 00:02:52.499
But then again, Saffa was a Magic Master.

59
00:02:53.400 --> 00:02:55.041
Maybe it would be easy for her.

60
00:02:55.061 --> 00:02:59.324
"We always use a Shackle spell in the vortex," Zann explained.

61
00:02:59.948 --> 00:03:01.589
"That way we're sure to stay together."

62
00:03:03.770 --> 00:03:08.051
Once they were shackled, they dived into the wormhole with Saffa leading the way.

63
00:03:08.071 --> 00:03:12.113
"Whoa!" she cried as soon as they were in the vortex.

64
00:03:13.174 --> 00:03:17.395
She waved her arms, which sent the whole group spinning wildly.

65
00:03:17.415 --> 00:03:19.576
"Stop that!"

66
00:03:19.696 --> 00:03:20.316
Gliss called.

67
00:03:20.336 --> 00:03:23.158
"Just let it pull you along."

68
00:03:23.178 --> 00:03:26.059
"I—I can't!"

69
00:03:26.419 --> 00:03:28.660
Saffa sounded breathless and scared.

70
00:03:29.724 --> 00:03:31.105
Zann glanced at his friends.

71
00:03:31.125 --> 00:03:33.267
"Maybe we'd better stop for a rest."

72
00:03:34.048 --> 00:03:34.768
Perda nodded.

73
00:03:36.049 --> 00:03:38.191
Zann grabbed the edge of the next wormhole.

74
00:03:38.932 --> 00:03:42.614
The world they were passing looked safe, so he pulled the group through.

75
00:03:43.815 --> 00:03:47.158
After landing on solid ground, he undid the Shackle spell.

76
00:03:48.239 --> 00:03:51.642
Saffa took a few deep breaths and then sat up.

77
00:03:52.322 --> 00:03:53.063
She looked around.

78
00:03:53.083 --> 00:03:53.923
"Oh my!

79
00:03:54.724 --> 00:03:56.546
Look, there are five suns.

80
00:03:57.346 --> 00:04:00.344
This must be Illumos.

81
00:04:00.364 --> 00:04:03.987
Apparently the multiple suns have a multiplying effect on the magic here.

82
00:04:04.708 --> 00:04:05.449
Let's try it!"

83
00:04:06.129 --> 00:04:07.410
She rubbed her fingers together.

84
00:04:08.251 --> 00:04:11.694
A second later a hat appeared, followed by several more!

85
00:04:12.935 --> 00:04:14.336
Saffa laughed with delight.

86
00:04:14.356 --> 00:04:18.019
"It's just as Nax and Asta said!"

87
00:04:18.340 --> 00:04:19.000
she exclaimed.

88
00:04:19.020 --> 00:04:21.142
"Oh, this is marvelous!

89
00:04:21.542 --> 00:04:23.064
I can't believe I'm really here."

90
00:04:23.944 --> 00:04:24.985
She clapped her hands.

91
00:04:25.005 --> 00:04:27.928
"I wonder if we could find Chronos next?

92
00:04:28.756 --> 00:04:30.277
I've always wanted to see that world.

93
00:04:30.357 --> 00:04:31.938
It sounds so relaxing."

94
00:04:32.659 --> 00:04:34.720
Zann glanced anxiously at his friends.

95
00:04:34.740 --> 00:04:37.342
"Shouldn't we focus on finding Morb?"

96
00:04:38.043 --> 00:04:39.323
Saffa's smile faded.

97
00:04:39.343 --> 00:04:40.804
"You're right, Zann.

98
00:04:41.925 --> 00:04:43.346
Sorry for getting distracted."

99
00:04:43.366 --> 00:04:44.727
"It's okay."

100
00:04:44.927 --> 00:04:45.608
Darb grinned.

101
00:04:45.628 --> 00:04:49.590
"We all got kind of distracted our first time visiting new worlds."

102
00:04:50.551 --> 00:04:53.433
After a short rest, Perda redid the Shackle spell.

103
00:04:55.134 --> 00:04:57.436
Saffa handed the glowing ring to Zann.

104
00:04:58.096 --> 00:05:00.597
"Maybe you'd better handle this," she said.

105
00:05:00.617 --> 00:05:03.978
"You have much more experience in the vortex than I do."

106
00:05:03.998 --> 00:05:06.038
"Thanks," Zann said.

107
00:05:06.058 --> 00:05:09.939
"But actually, Perda is better with that kind of stuff than I am."

108
00:05:10.800 --> 00:05:11.960
He handed over the ring.

109
00:05:12.600 --> 00:05:14.341
Perda slipped it onto her finger.

110
00:05:14.361 --> 00:05:16.781
"Okay, let's go!"

111
00:05:18.562 --> 00:05:21.463
This time Saffa was between Zann and Perda.

112
00:05:22.323 --> 00:05:25.864
That seemed to help her stay calm as they flew through the vortex.

113
00:05:26.792 --> 00:05:29.693
Zann glanced forward at Perda, who was leading the way.

114
00:05:29.713 --> 00:05:31.794
"Is the Tracking spell working?"

115
00:05:31.954 --> 00:05:32.355
he called.

116
00:05:32.375 --> 00:05:34.556
"Yes," Perda replied.

117
00:05:34.576 --> 00:05:36.857
"It's leading us this way!"

118
00:05:37.797 --> 00:05:40.398
They sped past several wormholes without slowing.

119
00:05:41.679 --> 00:05:45.341
Then Zann felt the ring pulling them toward a wormhole up ahead.

120
00:05:45.361 --> 00:05:48.502
"This must be where Morb is!"

121
00:05:48.802 --> 00:05:49.582
Gliss exclaimed.

122
00:05:49.602 --> 00:05:51.883
"Hold on, everyone!"

123
00:05:52.124 --> 00:05:52.744
Perda cried.

124
00:05:53.680 --> 00:05:57.641
Zann didn't have time to look at the world before being sucked through the wormhole.

125
00:05:58.701 --> 00:06:01.282
"Oof!" Zann grunted as he landed hard.

126
00:06:02.903 --> 00:06:04.943
Perda stood up and looked at all the trees.

127
00:06:04.963 --> 00:06:06.904
"Whew!" she said.

128
00:06:06.924 --> 00:06:09.044
"At least we're not in Fardark."

129
00:06:09.824 --> 00:06:10.665
Zann grinned.

130
00:06:10.685 --> 00:06:12.405
"I was thinking the same thing."

131
00:06:12.425 --> 00:06:14.446
"Where are we?"

132
00:06:14.746 --> 00:06:17.106
Gliss asked as Perda unshackled everyone.

133
00:06:17.927 --> 00:06:19.547
Zann didn't recognize the world.

134
00:06:19.947 --> 00:06:22.988
But he could feel magic energy snapping through the air.

135
00:06:23.940 --> 00:06:27.203
"I recognize those trees from the books," Saffa said.

136
00:06:27.223 --> 00:06:29.906
"I think we're in Atmo."

137
00:06:30.726 --> 00:06:33.309
Zann remembered that his parents had mentioned Atmo.

138
00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:38.974
Suddenly he noticed that Perda was several dozen strides away and moving fast.

139
00:06:38.994 --> 00:06:40.736
"Hey, Perda, wait up!"

140
00:06:42.277 --> 00:06:43.078
"I can't!"

141
00:06:43.238 --> 00:06:44.439
she called breathlessly.

142
00:06:44.459 --> 00:06:47.642
"The spell is really strong here!"

143
00:06:48.523 --> 00:06:49.664
Everyone rushed after her.

144
00:06:50.392 --> 00:06:54.776
They nearly crashed into her when she abruptly stopped near an enormous tree.

145
00:06:54.796 --> 00:06:57.278
"Careful!" Saffa whispered.

146
00:06:57.298 --> 00:06:59.740
"Morb must be nearby."

147
00:07:00.560 --> 00:07:03.543
A cloaked figure stepped out from behind the tree.

148
00:07:03.563 --> 00:07:07.946
"What in all the worlds are you doing here?"

149
00:07:08.306 --> 00:07:09.687
an irritated voice asked.

150
00:07:10.488 --> 00:07:12.270
The figure threw back its hood.

151
00:07:13.010 --> 00:07:14.191
Zann gasped.
